 to find him in a sea of  mist muijito effortlessly decapitates  him defeating an upper moon and only 14  years of age however after the fight his  mark vanishes and he immediately begins  to suffer from the effects of the poison  showing that the mark is only effective  for as long as it is manifested another  hashida that plays a major role in the  swordsmith village arc is mitsuri she is  the love hashira and even though she  looks like a helpless girl don't let the  looks fool you she's one of the  strongest swordsmen in the series at  swordsmith village when tanjido is  swallowed by one of zohaku-ten's tree  dragons mitsuri slices the creature's  head in half carrying tanjido on her  back safely mitsuti continues to battle  against zohaku-ten dodging his attacks  and countering with love breathing the  demon realizes that she is too fast and  is keeping up with his attacks and as a  response he uses blood demon art  countless striking trees lashing out  many wooden dragons mitsuti becomes a  bit nervous at how wide-ranged it is and  questions if she can get past it with  some effort she manages to get past the  attack and comes very close to  zohaku-ten the demon opens his mouth  confusing mitsuti though she brushes it  off and goes for his neck tangido yells  to her that he is not the real body and  he will not die if his head is cut off  the love hashira realizes her mistake  and is fiercely hit by zuhaku-ten's  compressed sound waves she loses  consciousness and slumps before the  upper rank while being in a coma mitsuti  had unconsciously awakened and obtained  her demon slayer mark which takes the  form of two hearts upside down and  opposite from each other with angel  wings on both sides once she regains  consciousness mitsuti engages zuhakuten  once again she gained a lot of power and  speed by awakening her demon slayer mark  and she managed to keep zuhaku-ten busy  while tanjiro defeated the main body  during the final battle in the infinity  castle demon slayer marks played a big  part in hashida's fight against upper  moons wandering through the castle  tanjuro and giu ran into none other than  upper rank 3 akaza himself as geo  attacks he immediately uses water  breathing impressing akaza as it had  been 50 years since he ran into someone  as good as gyu he uses his destructive  death sending a flurry of punches that  produce giant shock waves at giu which  he negates using his own creation water  breathing 11th form dead calm not long  after giu is sent flying away by one of  akaza's kicks yu soon returns angry and  finally manifests a demon slayer mark as  he begins to engage akaza again akaza  immediately matches guild's new speed  and eventually gains the upper hand  breaking giu's blade with a punch as  akazak closes in for the final blow his  hand is cut off by tanjiro mid attack  saving you you then re-engages akasa  once more but is eventually defeated  when akaza's final form breaks through  his dead calm technique yu then watches  as akaza is beheaded by tanjido this  fight is very interesting as we got to  see how strong upper moon 3 really is as  well as how the demon slayer mark may  not be enough to defeat some of the  upper moons somewhere else in the  infinity castle muichiro and genya were  about to die at the hands of upper moon  1 kokushibu suddenly genya's brother  sanemi rescues him by reflecting the  upper rank's attack with his wind  breathing kokushibu makes his distance  and sees that the win hashia has come in  his presence the two then start their  intense duel as both of their swords  clash kokushibu uses the moon breathing  forcing him to backstep away from the  attack sanomi is confused as to how so  many slashes are appearing even when the  upper rank isn't swinging his blade  sanemi counters his attack with the wind  breathing and kokushibu praises both  sonomy and his attacks for being at  their absolute peak sonomy thinks to  himself that he cannot stop getting  goosebumps at kokushibu's overall powers  and skill kokushibu eventually  overpowers senemy knocking him back and  decimating the surrounding landscape  wounding him heavily just as it seemed  that sanomi was about to die he was  saved by guilleme as sanomi goes to  stitch himself up gyome starts  exchanging blows with upper mood as the  battle progresses you may reveal that he  too has awakened his mark appearing as  cracked earth fissure-like patterns on  both of his forearms when awakened it  drastically increases his physical  abilities such as his strength allowing  him to stand his ground against  kokushibu for some time gilmei goes on  to use many of his stone breathing  techniques all in an attempt to gain  some advantage over the upper moon  meanwhile sanomi who was able to patch  up his injuries also awakens his demon  slayer mark that resembled a single  paper origami windmill that is green in  color with two dots on both sides on his  right cheek the mark dramatically  increases his physical capabilities as  seen when sonemy was still able to fight  and contend with kokoshibu despite being  grievously injured however even though  his physical endurance strength and  tolerance to pain dramatically increased  xanami couldn't land a significant hit  on kokushibu without assistance from  gyome and muichiro it took all three  hashidas with all their power combined  to finally defeat the upper rank 1. it's  safe to assume that without the powers  of the marks the demon slayers would  stand no chance against kokushibu and  would be killed very quickly later on  during the final battle against muzan  obanai also awakened his own demon  slayer mark his demon slayer mark took  the form of three snake-like tattoo  patterns the mark boosted all of iguro's  natural abilities as seen when he was  able to land powerful sword slashes  against muzan swiftly dodge and maneuver  himself to avoid all of his immensely  fast attacks and increase his physical  stamina and durability allowing him to  fight despite being severely injured  after remembering how muichiro turned  his blade red obani puts all of his  strength into gripping his blade turning  it bright red however he put too much  strength into his grip and almost  fainted due to the lack of oxygen  turning his niche in sword bright red  proved to be extremely effective against  muzan allowing his attacks to hamper his  immediate regeneration check out this  video where we explained all future  hashidas in the demon slayer core what  are you waiting for click it

